---
import SectionTitleAlt from "@/components/shared/section-title-alt.astro"

import SpeakerCard from "./speaker-card.astro"
---

<section class="flex w-full justify-center overflow-hidden bg-white px-4">
  <div class="flex w-full max-w-7xl flex-1 flex-col py-16 lg:py-26">
    <SectionTitleAlt title="Welcome Speech" subtitle="SPEAKERS" />

    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-[.55fr_1fr] md:gap-10 lg:mb-16 lg:gap-20">
      <div class="col-start-2 flex flex-col gap-8 text-slate-600">
        <SpeakerCard name="John Doe" affiliation="Company" image="/assets/images/speakers/placeholder.jpg">
          <p>
            Nam vehicula cursus purus non ultricies. Vestibulum faucibus dapibus erat, a finibus sem. Praesent lobortis ipsum facilisis magna ultrices
            accumsan. Cras ultrices egestas nulla, nec consequat neque laoreet nec. In hac habitasse platea dictumst. Morbi consectetur vel ex sit
            amet blandit. Aenean at efficitur mauris, hendrerit convallis orci.
          </p>
        </SpeakerCard>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
